<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-S&amp;P affirms Swire Pacific A rating.</title>
<headline>RTRS-S&amp;P affirms Swire Pacific A rating.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's said it had affirmed the A long term corporate credit rating of Swire Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said it had assigned an A rating to the HK$3.0 billion of floating rate notes to be issued by Swire Pacific Finance International Ltd, which are guaranteed by Swire.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said the rating outlook for Swire was stable.</p>
</text>
